ne in silicosis mortality during 1968--2002\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Death rates (per million persons aged > 15 years) were age-adjusted to the 2000 U.S. standard population.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For this analysis, PMR was adjusted by age, sex, and race, and 95% confidence intervals (CIs) were calculated by using Poisson regression analysis.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The proportionate mortality ratio (PMR § ) for silicosis was calculated by occupation and industry.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Defined as the observed number of deaths from silicosis in a specified occupation or industry divided by the expected number of silicosis deaths.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}